      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "什麼叫搬家？",
      "output_sha256": "047d80934fdd94377ca69c4ed15714735b4a56ba159aef2cb0d6725f85374c6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "047d80934fdd94377ca69c4ed15714735b4a56ba159aef2cb0d6725f85374c6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "移了一個窩就是啦！",
      "output_sha256": "2decc472b87cdcd34c61e747054cfc07e3e3dc4d32a649f8db60e2a269096a90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "2decc472b87cdcd34c61e747054cfc07e3e3dc4d32a649f8db60e2a269096a90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一輛馬車，載著兩個人和一個條箱，行李也在條箱裡。",
      "output_sha256": "c3acbbcf5c44a0d17a66e61a62370ac5ada115f7342d24a76d3f0eca543e6a07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.793207,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "37ee18726e46c7671d4332015d8b104c4d329333aeae2d46d39884341bffbfc3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c3acbbcf5c44a0d17a66e61a62370ac5ada115f7342d24a76d3f0eca543e6a07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "車行在街口了，街車，行人道上的行人，店鋪大玻璃窗裏的“模特兒”……汽車馳過去了，別人的馬車趕過我們急跑，馬車上面似乎坐着一對情人，女人的捲髮在帽沿外跳舞，男人的長臂沒有什麼用處一般，只爲着一種表示，才遮住女人的背後。",
      "output_sha256": "409cfd6365b3d196a2a1a774b50a87182aef250638b4035bf22f2602e5962996",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "409cfd6365b3d196a2a1a774b50a87182aef250638b4035bf22f2602e5962996",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "馬車飛馳而去，那一定是一對情侶在兜風……唯獨我們是在搬家。",
      "output_sha256": "1d7704fa700dc6c9ac229419a99cdd042734628daa314bb46e7b35170eef5c84",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.668837,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e8c0e2439d066bfbed565e19de19e648ef673c20996b8c1cbba2d2fe16846eed"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1d7704fa700dc6c9ac229419a99cdd042734628daa314bb46e7b35170eef5c84",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "天空有水狀的和雪融化春冰狀的白雲，我仰望着白雲，風從我的耳邊吹過，使我的耳朵鳴響。",
      "output_sha256": "a4c5d05470edd1b94bfe49e8aa1cb42d3319203c2bba9e7959003e39736b6f60",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "a4c5d05470edd1b94bfe49e8aa1cb42d3319203c2bba9e7959003e39736b6f60",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "到了：商市街××號。",
      "output_sha256": "c1a6e4fdb238983e0f421fa774dc6854edee29b100424680724507b25c0bbde4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "c1a6e4fdb238983e0f421fa774dc6854edee29b100424680724507b25c0bbde4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他夾著條箱，我提著臉盆，穿過漫長的院子，走到盡頭，第一個推門的是郎華，他說：“進去吧！”",
      "output_sha256": "d8f9523ff8b5a5cc44f6697561e543d9b7f17865bf66d3d09f77864418b9f45f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.643035,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dc2753d0d9c5260e6558e2eba17913b3f666eca5284013a52ca2ee86ea03fef3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d8f9523ff8b5a5cc44f6697561e543d9b7f17865bf66d3d09f77864418b9f45f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“家”就這樣地搬來，這就是“家”。",
      "output_sha256": "969b1fe1b56bee8e68e22307f25146f409cd7694ceab205145936e3dd04fd7b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "969b1fe1b56bee8e68e22307f25146f409cd7694ceab205145936e3dd04fd7b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一個男孩，穿着一雙很大的馬靴，跑着跳着喊：“媽……我老師搬來啦！”",
      "output_sha256": "fcc537d3bb293f06bf65cd89a7b2d0a8b16d8eaf381f8494171eee84476500df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "fcc537d3bb293f06bf65cd89a7b2d0a8b16d8eaf381f8494171eee84476500df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這就是他教武術的徒弟。",
      "output_sha256": "abd67d154024d9e8ca7b07dc69adf74c48d7ff1a3a78831e0c705225652d3d71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "abd67d154024d9e8ca7b07dc69adf74c48d7ff1a3a78831e0c705225652d3d71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "借來的那張鐵床，無論從門還是從窗都抬不進來。",
      "output_sha256": "031ef39814cc81ea5ba59f736b60c8dc1b3b274781c046f4e137c55c185c931f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.560786,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e34fc956284f8fa1083c68cc94b5cb596415e6f6a7dd363a3917d8872dad4f57"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "031ef39814cc81ea5ba59f736b60c8dc1b3b274781c046f4e137c55c185c931f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "擡不進來，真的就要睡地板嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "45bbcbdb1bcd8e0160e66f9f4bf341e74a3d38af9adf9bbe19c9753fd48c9803",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "45bbcbdb1bcd8e0160e66f9f4bf341e74a3d38af9adf9bbe19c9753fd48c9803",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "光着身子睡嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "29c8d6fedfaea83a53bf07d94cb6d36cb94e75645886d8bc315a15724111b016",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "29c8d6fedfaea83a53bf07d94cb6d36cb94e75645886d8bc315a15724111b016",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "鋪什麼？",
      "output_sha256": "ab820831e27b1105194b4101a720a05eba97b38e2bcf7c43875099c4fcd056aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab820831e27b1105194b4101a720a05eba97b38e2bcf7c43875099c4fcd056aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“老師，用斧子打吧。”",
      "output_sha256": "11ebec62a9f27b9f42a39c8e23825005307c686a9eace3578a0034826d78ea37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "11ebec62a9f27b9f42a39c8e23825005307c686a9eace3578a0034826d78ea37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "穿著長靴的孩子找來了一把斧子。",
      "output_sha256": "31def19a59f5fd5402ae0224eddb3f8780da8c7f66f3f8e7f7eb48e8dd884424",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.619048,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f057fefb7acd4c25fdf04e444e816ee823160bc6e4a62701b093b2e281fdfec0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "31def19a59f5fd5402ae0224eddb3f8780da8c7f66f3f8e7f7eb48e8dd884424",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "鐵床已經豎起，卡在門口，正當想抬出去卻無法時，郎華用斧子砍，鐵器碰撞發出震耳的響聲，門頂的玻璃碎了兩塊，最後床搬進來了，光光的身子放在地板中央。",
      "output_sha256": "9cb121ac858fedcbb639bc2811512ed92ec8fef6aefcab36c5038bc7161df9b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.617034,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3f338daf81ce43de38ca48eef67888bdfcf3cf9b6809c5ec00a87ae08b585775"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9cb121ac858fedcbb639bc2811512ed92ec8fef6aefcab36c5038bc7161df9b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "又向房東借一張桌子和兩把椅子。",
      "output_sha256": "f6aacd1a68341a0e615890c914e24abd11ed7e80d8cf16ce7bcc2a2aafbb6922",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6aacd1a68341a0e615890c914e24abd11ed7e80d8cf16ce7bcc2a2aafbb6922",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "郎華走了，說他去買水桶、菜刀、飯碗……",
      "output_sha256": "db3cc75a24dfad6f761da0a1f93b5fd064f3ae480a79038fbf012574e94e6fdf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "db3cc75a24dfad6f761da0a1f93b5fd064f3ae480a79038fbf012574e94e6fdf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我的肚子因為寒冷，也許因為疲憊，開始作痛。",
      "output_sha256": "99083ede238c15765e03ec03fbecd9b0f9f7b7032d7c8555aba35682cbfe8264",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.603045,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6294acb0a1ff0acfd043d4cf3b217d9f0791b26d0fe006850cd7c111237e709f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "99083ede238c15765e03ec03fbecd9b0f9f7b7032d7c8555aba35682cbfe8264",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "走到廚房去看，爐中的火熄了。",
      "output_sha256": "25e7870e018a278ea5654fe2e1be2dfc829c5ffdd0fc07465017c8b2e5a2835a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "25e7870e018a278ea5654fe2e1be2dfc829c5ffdd0fc07465017c8b2e5a2835a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "未搬來之前，或許有誰在這裡烤火，因此爐中還有一些木柴在燒。",
      "output_sha256": "97a0b92bf26caf29a3a7de0806cd6eff9ec597e04458343c02d2e32f87f22612",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.502968,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a8d98690cb50149b75ea799c1bb3f1f2846f6b5c79628bac6584edc32d050214"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "97a0b92bf26caf29a3a7de0806cd6eff9ec597e04458343c02d2e32f87f22612",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "鐵牀露着骨，玻璃窗漸漸結上冰來。",
      "output_sha256": "cb52fc1a503a812c9674a4b2533904a4421e804e9e97967f64efcffe456c973f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "cb52fc1a503a812c9674a4b2533904a4421e804e9e97967f64efcffe456c973f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "下午了，陽光失去了暖力，風漸漸卷着沙泥來吹打窗子……用冷水擦着地板，擦着窗臺……等到這一切做完，再沒有別的事可做的時候，我感到手有點痛，腳也有點痛。",
      "output_sha256": "ac055827d1e7353805656f3aede6abce8f80c9622ac475f31071b70412978b9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "ac055827d1e7353805656f3aede6abce8f80c9622ac475f31071b70412978b9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這裡不像旅館那樣靜謐，狗吠聲、雞鳴聲……還有人的吵鬧聲。",
      "output_sha256": "9f0c014a6c2ac36f3760d39897f78609d71fe73fe241e4afd11471abdb0537db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.565217,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c7a1a2b627d18a51eb770960af8472c75f2859fb294d68416fca7d44682e2cb2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9f0c014a6c2ac36f3760d39897f78609d71fe73fe241e4afd11471abdb0537db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "把手放在鐵爐板上也不能暖了，爐中連一顆火星也滅掉。",
      "output_sha256": "a16e7be4cec9375b1639fd14987ce905176bb91efbe6749d44a847b2080bf764",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "a16e7be4cec9375b1639fd14987ce905176bb91efbe6749d44a847b2080bf764",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "肚子痛，要上牀去躺一躺，哪裏是牀！",
      "output_sha256": "81b040d630db81917923e44a90d244e59c8576a01e792b0beab80df6e44b56b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "81b040d630db81917923e44a90d244e59c8576a01e792b0beab80df6e44b56b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "冰一樣的鐵條，怎麼敢去接近！",
      "output_sha256": "2dff3c3f836ab4321d47b7ae3b9aa4edb4c6ba66a5622e3494fb2dac4da5de16",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "2dff3c3f836ab4321d47b7ae3b9aa4edb4c6ba66a5622e3494fb2dac4da5de16",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我餓了，冷了，肚子又痛，郎華還不回來，心中無比焦躁！",
      "output_sha256": "50e7b12797d62a735734dfe4f497a321c7a662514d498718b28e777cc7de1764",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.60429,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a1c34df40a28af5fc518cf8e33640f428e70f49960a0b99f7afc1b4313f232be"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "50e7b12797d62a735734dfe4f497a321c7a662514d498718b28e777cc7de1764",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "連一隻表也沒有，根本不知道時間。",
      "output_sha256": "2dee9b190313bfece910497e3eb3ce07e869be587771f4319b5bd80177caaf92",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.705252,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1a77eff8c4ceb93399f9f7fecdf2c454b1a9d0f7a4afbcbe4a42855c491dfbeb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2dee9b190313bfece910497e3eb3ce07e869be587771f4319b5bd80177caaf92",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這是多麼無趣，多麼孤獨的家呀！",
      "output_sha256": "7167408ae7df3f8e170c935ab48f4603439158f73043cd5d4b6fcc412448ea3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.660302,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "20f02047af67707bcf2fbe92545c379bf8848ce811fb204bfc23aab7dbc43829"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7167408ae7df3f8e170c935ab48f4603439158f73043cd5d4b6fcc412448ea3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我好像落下井的鴨子一般寂寞並且隔絕。",
      "output_sha256": "0ed0b05997250a237c81a146f596806f566d06334b656d5a1bf0ed369ec14eb3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ed0b05997250a237c81a146f596806f566d06334b656d5a1bf0ed369ec14eb3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "肚痛、寒冷和飢餓伴着我……什麼家？",
      "output_sha256": "21d80624f990fc06c3ae7a28ef7bc02582b457385adbeeffb82d615d6b5821c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "21d80624f990fc06c3ae7a28ef7bc02582b457385adbeeffb82d615d6b5821c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "簡直是夜的廣場，沒有陽光，沒有溫暖。",
      "output_sha256": "309494afac45a7c24bf9d9ea8a17b327f6f6e9ffcf6a147c63c54a1b60a462d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "309494afac45a7c24bf9d9ea8a17b327f6f6e9ffcf6a147c63c54a1b60a462d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "門扇大聲哐啷哐啷地響，是郎華回來，他打開小水桶的蓋給我看：小刀，筷子，碗，水壺，他把這些都擺出來，紙包裏的白米也倒出來。",
      "output_sha256": "701fdb98e85a18c664d341ee9e17c9805b733f7c98eae2fee367f49871603563",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "701fdb98e85a18c664d341ee9e17c9805b733f7c98eae2fee367f49871603563",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只要他在我身旁，餓也不難忍了，肚痛也輕了。",
      "output_sha256": "566ddcfc20e7ef211111d1ea5e1ed1c41b284a689b8ac24d0df0e6c4da649732",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "566ddcfc20e7ef211111d1ea5e1ed1c41b284a689b8ac24d0df0e6c4da649732",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "買回來的草褥放在門外，我還不知道，我問他：",
      "output_sha256": "544b26be8534f7eb4a35e3449262f2da9fd52e1575f9f2babd297c9a47977a50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "544b26be8534f7eb4a35e3449262f2da9fd52e1575f9f2babd297c9a47977a50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是買的嗎？”",
      "output_sha256": "3ddc2bced00d7e16d556b6b79f73513357a372d55152c51a74f00841f05bae96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ddc2bced00d7e16d556b6b79f73513357a372d55152c51a74f00841f05bae96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“不是買的，是哪裏來的！”",
      "output_sha256": "2ae637d50b7574f07903b772e978a35301a3ea86f8e93b8c1948db58b28f650e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ae637d50b7574f07903b772e978a35301a3ea86f8e93b8c1948db58b28f650e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“錢，還剩多少？”",
      "output_sha256": "7a24a54301eb5aaa89f57de141c77ad1f0591ffb4d49883e7db84a4d5a8f4cc9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "7a24a54301eb5aaa89f57de141c77ad1f0591ffb4d49883e7db84a4d5a8f4cc9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“還剩！",
      "output_sha256": "f3e4c74b52bc747aebd5d010da1dd3a83d8be2b103c0bf796c0e81d7f2106b0a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "f3e4c74b52bc747aebd5d010da1dd3a83d8be2b103c0bf796c0e81d7f2106b0a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "怕是不夠哩！”",
      "output_sha256": "0cdcff6a12b085e465c10aa2a126d3f2ca2f4c6dbb7d3d42c9339f509cb85a55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "0cdcff6a12b085e465c10aa2a126d3f2ca2f4c6dbb7d3d42c9339f509cb85a55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "等他買木柈回來，我就開始點火。",
      "output_sha256": "38ce1dea49fc97fb4ee463d47372125d0da5022d5b6da221ec787211170bf1e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "38ce1dea49fc97fb4ee463d47372125d0da5022d5b6da221ec787211170bf1e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "站在爐邊，竟然也像小主婦一樣準備晚餐。",
      "output_sha256": "2b752686c02193ec25bd4cadc7a16e598710c676ab070f4b9bb16d857b940982",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.644175,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2270919ab73b8eef94a44c60e90c7983fa198bbd7c9da82621f736ec850f0550"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2b752686c02193ec25bd4cadc7a16e598710c676ab070f4b9bb16d857b940982",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "油菜燒焦了，白米飯半生不熟，只能說它是粥，比粥還硬一點；說它是飯，比飯還黏一點。",
      "output_sha256": "2afb065ca109bf55dfce4a514ff99749a80b2124edcf850b443a275c83e846ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.782508,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2f09b3902ffb08e17e3d41afdd5acbbc52228040ac9fea750c2e76013902aa1a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2afb065ca109bf55dfce4a514ff99749a80b2124edcf850b443a275c83e846ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這算是我成了“妻子”，不成妻子，怎麼會做飯？",
      "output_sha256": "0d8c806d3039c7d428b404289e2b0015206f22f4a6dd198399cc40d64e452091",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.357353,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f18dedf1cf06ba78a619b74c829da1d4ec899d5e5b6f80eb0456c1391b29e17b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0d8c806d3039c7d428b404289e2b0015206f22f4a6dd198399cc40d64e452091",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不做婦人，哪裏懂得燒飯？",
      "output_sha256": "3c1912946c301e0c21fd6a2505524bf909227d3b69bb1d095bcf54867255c54f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c1912946c301e0c21fd6a2505524bf909227d3b69bb1d095bcf54867255c54f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "晚上，房東來了，似乎是來訪問的！",
      "output_sha256": "e2e1836b9becd5a2aebc91c74d8ec69207d8c8b02aa8cd70efc809a88c329780",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.354104,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "61a244b321e0168971a0fb7132a6177e7abc4f44bb64d74e4a8ccf26489f9c02"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e2e1836b9becd5a2aebc91c74d8ec69207d8c8b02aa8cd70efc809a88c329780",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "房東就是那個穿馬靴的孩子的父親。",
      "output_sha256": "f2bde708439a8349f630d3fbd6bc333537d3753a9aa8e4807ccb44f8055ea5a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.675,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "167fb28bab17f79e7b3b7fd1ed79145246224ecb88582243d2859354b0f6a5e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f2bde708439a8349f630d3fbd6bc333537d3753a9aa8e4807ccb44f8055ea5a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我三姐來啦！”",
      "output_sha256": "6bfb7f205773894c8d77ea4451355f162e3e8bf00696de119d914ab2ef6556cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "6bfb7f205773894c8d77ea4451355f162e3e8bf00696de119d914ab2ef6556cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "過了一會兒，那孩子又來敲門。",
      "output_sha256": "7e300194cfec61e0fae9c1676ef9e09ab34d265ec98f7f704fed4f6c35692f33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.53125,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "93167150b0d586e88e6e92d3b5e6cf027a76d6150897d85ab026ef26a32f153d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7e300194cfec61e0fae9c1676ef9e09ab34d265ec98f7f704fed4f6c35692f33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我一點也不能認識她。",
      "output_sha256": "4a3b979649b9b4d2705f1e50c48f00b740e5202a52bbd889f1e507e4d37a850e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a3b979649b9b4d2705f1e50c48f00b740e5202a52bbd889f1e507e4d37a850e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她說她在學校時每天差不多都看見我，不管在操場或是禮堂。",
      "output_sha256": "79f6f09782d50aa93fda9bc1f9314c6719900c8b68fa839aa039cb9aede86864",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "79f6f09782d50aa93fda9bc1f9314c6719900c8b68fa839aa039cb9aede86864",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的名字她還記得很熟。",
      "output_sha256": "66fa5f61b471d6081ac5d52c056632cc87561fe620fef96f1c79f98823b03835",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "66fa5f61b471d6081ac5d52c056632cc87561fe620fef96f1c79f98823b03835",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“也不過三年，就忘得這樣厲害……你在哪一班？”",
      "output_sha256": "7d8bd0dcf2511672e7797bf6d8d3f0b84a03c78c01a84ea36d4e783c11969fc2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "7d8bd0dcf2511672e7797bf6d8d3f0b84a03c78c01a84ea36d4e783c11969fc2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我問。",
      "output_sha256": "24bb84ec91c6ca1dc3a29f0f2c33a0d724f506c1b313815915888f1374aca0a8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "24bb84ec91c6ca1dc3a29f0f2c33a0d724f506c1b313815915888f1374aca0a8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“第九班。”",
      "output_sha256": "9845af08730889cadc7e58e6b9677b2744caddcea979ed081b812641aa1f923e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "9845af08730889cadc7e58e6b9677b2744caddcea979ed081b812641aa1f923e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“第九班，和郭小嫺一班嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "b39a63b739357e267f8be2b3f849ab969434bce8d800fdd81a0517ecd48899d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "b39a63b739357e267f8be2b3f849ab969434bce8d800fdd81a0517ecd48899d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "郭小嫺每天打球，我倒認識她。”",
      "output_sha256": "dade9b1b654bd67a074e718ab1cb524b6a868256b74d3adee08c0a7e3338fa3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "dade9b1b654bd67a074e718ab1cb524b6a868256b74d3adee08c0a7e3338fa3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“對啦，我也打籃球。”",
      "output_sha256": "4f5a32a5f6d429d97a373c1b71d9eb1f93a8c22edb3df4107685727623feda67",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f5a32a5f6d429d97a373c1b71d9eb1f93a8c22edb3df4107685727623feda67",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但無論如何我也想不起來，坐在我對面的簡直是一個從未見過的面孔。",
      "output_sha256": "b16602435a0b2d53192203d66cdb36eb211977f7b795a55a8c9ff75c021809c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "b16602435a0b2d53192203d66cdb36eb211977f7b795a55a8c9ff75c021809c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 32,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“那時候，你十幾歲吧？”",
      "output_sha256": "7d414df34f93f52eeaa5c2ddbc1d8fc46e58af2cad1c8ddcf8023c040a4241f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": 0.723366,
