      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d7b2a21a1180fa44462cef2b80a536085af4d6ffc6f7820989797a881751421e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        66
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 34,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我想了一下，笑了。",
      "output_sha256": "22e9a9a7c2157776ce0bafb0a6d396cb37ac6996ee58e05759e39e4712d6b6d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": 0.8075,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        67
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5d62bd10f1d01db55ce8ce03691598cb8a85f58cae7345f94775d6fd3c86970e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_ai_sha256": "22e9a9a7c2157776ce0bafb0a6d396cb37ac6996ee58e05759e39e4712d6b6d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        67
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她卷皺的頭髮，掛胭脂的嘴，比我好像還大一點，因爲回憶完全把我帶回往昔的境地去。",
      "output_sha256": "61c3fc60212b643ff96203085a78423997617c0ef7c12a3d9532da1c06ddb5a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "61c3fc60212b643ff96203085a78423997617c0ef7c12a3d9532da1c06ddb5a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其實，我已經二十二歲了，與她相比，恐怕已經顯得老了。",
      "output_sha256": "6311a2bc96637b3a11ba2301eefe3fb81775ab548cde5fcc3ffdc6ba3b868d66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": 0.539201,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        69
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a51355fe97084314a0ee8c4d2194a1db6a4bda9d2a327a2c78c02b279ff5e1bb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6311a2bc96637b3a11ba2301eefe3fb81775ab548cde5fcc3ffdc6ba3b868d66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        69
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "尤其是在蠟燭光裏，假若有鏡子讓我照一下，我一定慘敗得比三十歲更老。",
      "output_sha256": "cc0d11554029c22414be7c38002d032ccd2349af1b3b7b440a1857a0c1002c29",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "cc0d11554029c22414be7c38002d032ccd2349af1b3b7b440a1857a0c1002c29",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 36,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“三姐！",
      "output_sha256": "64bd3cb7f4d7a499884357f4fcacaf348b7c1b1817487df8f40562a27e242557",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "64bd3cb7f4d7a499884357f4fcacaf348b7c1b1817487df8f40562a27e242557",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 36,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你老師來啦。”",
      "output_sha256": "694325816c480ed6d9ec27797c7ad8433aa7859be97d13bd040d6da4a0fd698f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "694325816c480ed6d9ec27797c7ad8433aa7859be97d13bd040d6da4a0fd698f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我去學俄文。”",
      "output_sha256": "826f100fa10fc9c9fe26344a41cb10713173135053a4007fbc00ecbe137e8ca3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_human_sha256": "826f100fa10fc9c9fe26344a41cb10713173135053a4007fbc00ecbe137e8ca3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她弟弟在外面叫她，她便站起來說。",
      "output_sha256": "7df1235ec692fc9c83b7e5243a47547354b6b32ee172bf9c8a5c9a17954c6b9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": 0.73408,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
