      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7df1235ec692fc9c83b7e5243a47547354b6b32ee172bf9c8a5c9a17954c6b9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        74
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 38,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她的態度爽快，完全是少女的風範，身材修長，細腰，閃身出門而去。",
